) on QUERY | MUTATION | SUBSCRIPTION | FRAGMENT_DEFINITION | VARIABLE_DEFINITION | SCHEMA | SCALAR | OBJECT | UNION | ENUM | ENUM_VALUE | INPUT_OBJECT | INPUT_FIELD_DEFINITION
